{"step_index":1789,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-10-26T13:21:02Z","input_tokens":2217,"cache_read_tokens":202285,"output_tokens":648,"tool_calls":[{"name":"write_file","args":{"Content":"# 3tched-container: Modular Incus Identity Containers\n\nThis repository contains the JSON specifications, Incus profiles, and storage automation for launching **3tchedFS identity system containers**.\n\n## Architecture & Separation of Concerns\n\n1. **Modular Separation**:\n   * The container runtime, Incus JSON profiles, and template definitions li